      "description": "Pin-to-moment identifications with a federal photographer credit: Diamond Eagle pin at the 23 Jan 1997 swearing-in (Clinton Library/Ralph Alswang, ALB-S-0084) = the moment of ALB-M-0059/-0014; Sunburst pin, Marine One 1999 (Clinton Library/Sharon Farmer, ALB-S-0092: no catalog item found); Bug pin, UN news conference 14 Sep 2000 (U.S. Department of State, ALB-S-0086: not digitized at NARA); Peace Dove, Rwanda 1997 (U.S. Department of State, ALB-S-0090: not digitized). Glass Ceiling page (ALB-S-0087) credits a Clinton Library/Barbara Kinney photo but names the pin only for the 2013 AP photo."
    },
